## CI/CD Flow Diagram

```
Developer Push / PR
        │
        ▼
  [ci.yml — Every Branch]
  ├─ flake8 lint (blocking for syntax errors)
  ├─ pytest 73 tests ✅
  └─ Upload coverage.xml artifact
        │
        │ (PR merged to main)
        ▼
  [cd.yml — Main Only]
  ├─ 🔐 Gate: Full test suite must pass
  ├─ Config dry-run validation
  ├─ Package src/ → pipeline_artifact_<sha>.zip
  └─ Create GitHub Release with artifact
        
  [pr_validation.yml — Every PR]
  ├─ Validate title: type(scope): description
  ├─ Check new src/*.py files have tests/test_*.py
  └─ Post summary comment on PR
```
